-- Classifier & Self-Derived Fiber-Invariance Proofs (ZERO C strings, ZERO floats, ZERO postulates).
--
-- Extends `lib/hx-vision.hypercubical` + `lib/hx-autoprove.hypercubical` to full 2D images:
