--   2. Exact 2D Multi-Scale Topological Signature (`TopoSig`):
--        * 1st-order spatial gradients (`Jet^1`: dx, dy)
--        * 2nd-order spatial curvature (`Jet^2`: dxx, dyy, dxy)
--        * 2D Generalized Stokes Plaquette Holonomy (`Hol`)
--   3. Machine-Checked Universal Theorems (ALL proved universally for ALL Z pixels, 0 postulates!):
