--        * `vc-thm-jet2-affine-inv`  : 2D Jet^2 is identically invariant to ALL linear ramps c + gx*x + gy*y
--        * `vc-thm-fiber-lossless`   : Patch3x3 ~= (s : TopoSig) x fiber vc-topo-sig s (0-error recon!)
--        * `vc-thm-class-contractible`: Sing (vc-topo-sig p) is contractible (canonical witness, 0 softmax)
